{"id": "31627", "title": "文心雕龙", "author": "刘勰", "category": "文学名著", "count": 50, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/31/31627.htm", "intro": "古代文学理论著作。刘勰撰。成书于南朝齐和帝中兴元﹑二年(501～502)间。它是中国文学理论批评史上第一部有严密体系的﹐“体大而虑周”(章学诚《文史通义‧诗话篇》)的文学理论专著。魏晋时期﹐中国的文学理论有了很大的发展。到南北朝﹐逐渐形成繁荣的局面。文学创作和文学理论批评在其历史发展中所积累起来的丰富经验﹐既为《文心雕龙》的出现准备了条件﹐也在《文心雕龙》中得到了反映。", "base": "files/article/html/31/31627", "chapters": [{"title": "原道第一", "file": "2043928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "征圣第二", "file": "2043929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "宗经第三", "file": "2043930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正纬第四", "file": "2043932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "辨骚第五", "file": "2043933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "明诗第六", "file": "2043934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "乐府第七", "file": "2043935.html", "available": false}, {"title": "诠赋第八", "file": "2043936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "颂赞第九", "file": "2043937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "祝盟第十", "file": "2043938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "铭箴第十一", "file": "2043939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "诔碑第十二", "file": "2043940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "哀吊第十三", "file": "2043941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "杂文第十四", "file": "2043942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谐讔第十五", "file": "2043943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "史传第十六", "file": "2043944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "诸子第十七", "file": "2043945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "论说第十八", "file": "2043946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "诏策第十九", "file": "2043947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "檄移第二十", "file": "2043948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "封禅第二十一", "file": "2043949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "章表第二十二", "file": "2043950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "奏启第二十三", "file": "2043951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "议对第二十四", "file": "2043952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "书记第二十五", "file": "2043953.html", "a